:name: MG24 generic Matter boot harness
:description: Boots an arbitrary MG24 Matter application ELF on BRD4186C. Set $bin before include. Matter apps load at flash 0x08006000; vector table is at the load base.

using sysbus
emulation SetGlobalSerialExecution true
emulation CreateIEEE802_15_4Medium "wireless"
emulation CreateBLEMedium "ble"

mach create "mg24"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @platforms/boards/silabs/brd4186c.repl

$vtor?=0x08006000
macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $bin
    cpu VectorTableOffset $vtor
"""
runMacro $reset

connector Connect sysbus.radio wireless
logLevel 3
